Closing balance (bank):      1,327,705.75
Closing balance (ledger):    1,327,705.75
Difference:                          0.00
Prepared by: Accounting    Reviewed by: Financial Controller
"@
    Set-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path "$acc\Vendor_Master_List.csv" -Value @"
VendorID,Name,Contact,Email,PaymentTerms
V-001,Acme Networking Solutions Inc.,M. Grant,billing@acme-networking.example,Net 30
V-002,Rackline Hardware Distribution,S. Patel,ar@rackline.example,Net 45
V-003,Brightline Office Supplies,K. Moore,accounts@brightline.example,Net 30
V-004,Northwind Cloud Services,J. Ortega,finance@northwind.example,Net 15
"@
    Set-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path "$acc\Expense_Policy.txt" -Value @"
PHANTOM CORP - EXPENSE POLICY
- Submit receipts within 30 days.
- Hotel limit: 180 USD per night. Meals: 45 USD per day.
- Expenses over 1,000 USD require pre-approval by a Senior Manager.
"@

    # --- Sales documents ---
    $sal = "$base\Sales"
    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $sal -Force | Out-Null
    Set-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path "$sal\Customer_Accounts.csv" -Value @"
AccountID,Customer,Industry,AccountManager,AnnualValue,Renewal
C-1001,Harbourview Logistics,Transport,Sales Team A,84000,2025-03-31
C-1002,Greenfield Medical Group,Healthcare,Sales Team A,126500,2025-06-30
C-1003,Oakridge Municipal Council,Public Sector,Sales Team B,212000,2025-01-31
C-1004,Bluewater Retail Ltd,Retail,Sales Team B,47800,2025-09-30
"@
    Set-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path "$sal\Sales_Pipeline_Q4_2024.csv" -Value @"
Opportunity,Customer,Stage,Value,CloseDate,Probability
Managed SOC,Greenfield Medical Group,Proposal,180000,2024-12-15,60
Network Refresh,Summit Engineering,Negotiation,96000,2024-11-30,80
DR as a Service,Oakridge Municipal Council,Proposal,145000,2025-02-28,50
"@

    # --- Public breadcrumb: the deployment runbook was "accidentally" left in a public folder. ---
    # The IT share itself is restricted below, so this stays the unauthenticated path to svc_deploy.
    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "$base\IT-Notices" -Force | Out-Null
    Set-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path "$base\IT-Notices\Deployment_Runbook_DRAFT.txt" -Value @"
INTERNAL NETWORK RUNBOOK - IT OPERATIONS  (DRAFT - do not distribute outside IT)

Deployment automation:
  The unattended deployment runs under the service account "svc_deploy".
  Current password: Deploy2024!   (kept in sync with the imaging server)
  This account is a member of IT Helpdesk and is used for scripted rollouts.

Reminders:
  - The front-desk kiosk (WS-INTAKE) still uses its build-time machine password.
  - Rotate svc_deploy after the Q3 imaging cycle completes.
  - DNS service restarts are handled by the script in \\DC1\Common\DNSrestart.ps1
"@

    # --- Per-department NTFS ACLs (inheritance broken so Everyone from C:\Common does NOT leak in) ---
    $acl = @{
        'Finance'   = @("$nb\Accounting",       'M')
        'HR'        = @("$nb\Senior management",'M')
        'Sales'     = @("$nb\Sales",            'M')
        'IT'        = @("$nb\IT Helpdesk",      'M')
        'Backups'   = @("$nb\IT Admins",        'F')
    }
    foreach ($d in $acl.Keys) {
        $p = "$base\$d"
        New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $p -Force | Out-Null
        Try {
            icacls "$p" /inheritance:r /grant:r "*S-1-5-32-544:(OI)(CI)F" /grant:r "*S-1-5-18:(OI)(CI)F" /grant:r "$($acl[$d][0]):(OI)(CI)$($acl[$d][1])" | Out-Null
            if (-not (Get-SmbShare -Name $d -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
                New-SmbShare -Name $d -Path $p -FullAccess "Everyone" | Out-Null
            }
            Write-Info "Share \\DC1\$d -> $p (NTFS: $($acl[$d][0]) only)"
        } Catch { Write-Bad "Department share $d could not be configured: $($_.Exception.Message)" }
    }
    # Backup Operators can also read Backups (matches the Backup Operators plant).
    Try { icacls "$base\Backups" /grant:r "*S-1-5-32-551:(OI)(CI)RX" | Out-Null } Catch {}
