function VulnAD-VulnerableServices {
    # --- Rejetto HFS 2.3 (CVE-2014-6287) ---
    # The binary is NOT downloaded here: the current 2.3m release is PATCHED against this bug.
    # Place a vulnerable build (HFS 2.3 / 2.3b, i.e. BEFORE 2.3c) at C:\HFS\hfs.exe BEFORE running the script.
    # Port 8080 is used because IIS (AD CS Web Enrollment) already owns port 80 on the DC.
